Frameweave changes: WGSL public Pixel ABI, ordinary typed native functions,
explicit signals/options, scene-linear PM alpha, compensated interpolation,
PM-before-bilinear filtering, explicit endpoint/seam policies, own validated
integer hash reuse instead of GL Transitions sine hash, color-aware masks,
F16/32F logical publication, compensated twist inversion and numerical fixtures.
No original project UI, timeline, document model, renderer or assets imported.
Other independent transition math and adapters are Apache-2.0 Frameweave code.
No Adobe/Cycore proprietary code, assets or naming entitlement are included.

Extended controls: polygon coverage and explicit-map reactor adapters retain
EffectCraft MIT provenance above. The Gaussian numerical validation fixture
uses the unmodified Frameweave Apache-2.0 kernel from frozen 22370b15287262e,
verified by SHA in controls-sources.json. Actual Resource scenes consume the
reviewed native-image-effects@0.3.0 R1 package through its public processPa API.
Proprietary Adobe/Cycore manuals are specification references only; no manual,
proprietary pixel oracle, camera implementation or assets are redistributed.

Card camera/flat lighting/jitter equations additionally adapt card3d.rs at the
same fixed EffectCraft commit and MIT license. Verbatim source SHA and changes
are recorded in CARD_AND_TIME.md. Original Piece renderer/UI/time model excluded.
